<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of September&#160;30, 2024, prepayments of projects were transferred
to other current assets as the projects were expected to be completed within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c104" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="us-gaap:ConstructionContractorContractDuration" id="ixv-6013">12</ix:nonNumeric> months from September 30, 2024.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

