<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The payables for park facilities mainly are infrastructure
work for the amusement park.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p><div>

</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:AccountsPayableAccruedLiabilitiesAndOtherLiabilitiesDisclosureCurrentTextBlock" id="ixv-4504"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>8. ACCRUED EXPENSES AND OTHER PAYABLES</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfAccountsPayableAndAccruedLiabilitiesTableTextBlock" id="ixv-4509"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The amount of accrued expenses and other payables
consisted of the following:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<table cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-spacing: 0px;">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
